      "id": "cinematic.fade-has-independent-timing",
      "domain": "cinematic",
      "subject": "camera fade",
      "statement": "Camera fades have explicit fade-in, hold, and fade-out durations and can be combined with delayed teleports or camera changes, creating another scheduler/timing surface inside a cutscene.",
